{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A powerful and easy-to-use tool to personalize your visual experience.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>\ud83d\ude80</strong>\ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f Change atmosphere during gaming or work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Adjust color and brightness as you wish to protect your eyes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Use your JPG/PNG images as screen filters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83c\udfa5 Use your MP4/WEBM/AVI/MKV/MOV videos as screen filters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong> </strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Color Filters:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time RGB, saturation, brightness adjustment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >0-100% transparency control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your filters to a list</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easily apply / rename / delete your saved filters</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Image Filters:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add JPG/PNG images via drag-and-drop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Image transparency adjustment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your images to a list</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easily apply / change opacity / delete your saved images</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa5<strong> Video Filters:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add MP4/WEBM/AVI/MKV/MOV videos via drag-and-drop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Video transparency adjustment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your videos to a list</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easily apply / change opacity / delete your saved videos</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd52 Scheduler System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the Scheduler tab, you can set a specific time to automatically:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle the All FilterMob filters on/off</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatically load a saved profile</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shutdown PC</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restart PC</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lock  PC</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcbe Advanced Profile Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can now save every setting (Color, Image, Video, Gamma, and System Brightness) as a named <strong>Profile</strong>.000</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saved profiles are now listed with visual icons (Color previews or thumbnails).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between &quot;Game Mode,&quot; &quot;Reading Mode,&quot; or &quot;Night Mode&quot;... (your profiles)  with a single click.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcbe Automatic Save Management:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All settings are automatically saved</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last used filters and overlays are remembered and automatically set at startup</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your settings are safe even in unexpected shutdowns</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u26a1 Performance</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized Efficiency:Designed for low resource consumption.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2328\ufe0f Quick Actions:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant control via customizable global shortcuts (Shift+Esc, F-keys)\u00a0 </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic system language detection (30+ languages).</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3895750?t=1766033480","backgroun